<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY APRIL JOBLESS RATE 10.8PCT VS MARCH 11PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY APRIL JOBLESS RATE 10.8PCT VS MARCH 11PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's unemployment rate fell to 10.8 percent in April from 11 percent in March, the Labour Ministry said on Wednesday. The unemployment rate in April 1996 was 11.2 percent, the Ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p> HUNGARY JOBLESS	   April '97   March '97     April '96</p>
<p> registered unemployed   482,300	493,300	 511,890</p>
<p> rate			    10.8	  11.0	    11.2</p>
<p>Note: - All percentage figures are based on the size of active population in January 1996.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
